<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Before the Thaw</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora have been best friends for 18 years. When Adora's life gets turned upside down shortly before she leaves for college, Catra is forced to grapple with what losing Adora might mean for her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Takes place in a college AU, heavy emphasis is placed on sensitive topics! Obligatory trigger warning: self harm, eating disorders, transphobia, dubcon, suicidal ideations, abuse (physical and psychological), and much more. Sorry, I can't resist a little angst :3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Always remember that you are loved, even if you don't know it. &amp;lt;3&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>LongHairCatra</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
